            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-1072] CompactionTest is flaky when disks are almost full</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-1072</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The tests will fail when the disks are almost full. Because it will trigger force compaction.&lt;/p&gt;

